"""Baseline: predicts the mean activation at the first token of each document, zero elsewhere."""
READS = ()

def step(carry, prefix, upstream):
    t = prefix.position
    first = t == 0 or prefix.document_ids[t] != prefix.document_ids[t - 1]
    return None, (0.07 if first else 0.0)

programs.sol:
"""A written-morpheme detector, strongest on Chinese 会/會 ('can/will; meeting').

The character alone and its negated modal form are especially strong. Longer
compounds dilute it, particularly society, opportunity and institution names.
There are weaker responses to related Korean/Vietnamese spellings, Latin
hui/hoi fragments, the related characters 回/絵, and gathering 汇/彙.
