Persistence, surprise and immediacy get large positive values; aspect,
scope and degree markers get smaller ones. Normalize traditional spelling
and recognize words divided between tokens. Dictionary compounds help
separate an adverb from a syllable in a different word. A few Vietnamese
and Thai markers share the response. Particles and repeated middle dots
are negative. Document starts and the initial `Title:` header are separate
positional effects. Most other activations are left unmodeled.
